==English==

===Etymology===
From {{suffix|en|second base|man}}.

===Noun===
{{en-noun|second basemen}}

# {{lb|en|baseball}} The [[infield]] defensive [[player]] that stands between the [[first baseman]] and the [[shortstop]], normally on the right field side of [[second base]].
#: {{ux|en|The '''second baseman''' started the 4-6-3 [[double play]].}}

